# Local debug mode has to reach the environment before any auto-configuration is evaluated, because a
# provider starter fails while its chat model is being created — before a planner is ever asked.
#
# 本地调试模式必须在任何自动配置被求值之前进入环境：provider starter 在创建 chat model 时就会失败 ——
# 早于任何规划器被问到。
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
cn.com.keelbase.runtime.pipeline.LocalDebugEnvironmentPostProcessor
